# Checklist 42 (the emulator half): follow a JPL Horizons target. Asks
# Horizons over the network for the Moon (301), which is in the tracking
# band at some time in any 12 hours; only the target's name and the time
# are sent, never the site.
name    JPL follow: the Moon from Horizons
timeout 240

expect 30  [SCENARIO] JPL
wait   5
press  GOTO:PASSES
type   JPL 301
press  GOTO:FOLLOW
expect 10  Target: asking JPL Horizons for 301.
expect 90  in the band for
absent 5   Target not followed
shot   following
press  GOTO:FOLLOW
# Stopped. If that was before its window opened, it must say it never
# reached the target, not claim a worst error of 0.00 deg (phase 127).
expect 15  stopped: stopped by the operator.
absent 1   Worst error on target 0.00 deg
